#: ../../source/docs/common-modalai-voxl.rst:84
#: 160187e7bd464b66a76a468bbbd9a00a
msgid ""
":ref:`RC6_OPTION <RC6_OPTION>` = 90 (EKF Pos Source) to allow the pilot to "
"use channel 6 to switch between Source1 (e.g. GPS+Compass) and Source2 (e.g."
" VOXL camera).  The switch's low position is Source1 (GPS+Compass), middle "
"position is Source2 (e.g. VOXL), and high position is Source3 (e.g. None) "
"which will lead to the EKF losing its position estimate and triggering an "
"EKF failsafe.  To avoid pilot error triggering an EKF failsafe you may wish "
"to copy EK3_SRC1_xxx or EK2_SRC2_xxx to EK3_SRC3_xx."
msgstr ""
":ref:`RC6_OPTION <RC6_OPTION>` = 90（EKF Pos Source），允许飞手使用通道 6 在 Source1（如 "
"GPS+罗盘）和 Source2（如 VOXL 相机）之间切换。开关低位为 Source1（GPS+罗盘），中位为 Source2（如 "
"VOXL），高位为 Source3（如 None），这将导致 EKF 丢失位置估计并触发 EKF 失控保护。为避免飞手误操作触发 EKF "
"失控保护，可以将 EK3_SRC1_xxx 或 EK2_SRC2_xxx 复制到 EK3_SRC3_xx。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-modalai-voxl.rst:85
#: f756051e363540498bbfc75ae0f925ee
msgid ""
":ref:`RC7_OPTION <RC7_OPTION>` = 80 (Viso Align) to allow the pilot to use "
"channel 7 to re-align the camera's yaw with the AHRS/EKF yaw before flight."
"  Re-aligning yaw before takeoff is a good idea or loss of position control "
"(aka \"toilet bowling\") may occur."
msgstr ""
":ref:`RC7_OPTION <RC7_OPTION>` = 80（Viso Align），允许飞手在飞行前使用通道 7 将相机的偏航与 "
"AHRS/EKF 偏航重新对齐。起飞前重新对齐偏航是个好习惯，否则可能出现位置控制失效（俗称「马桶旋转」）。"

